	(text "USB (CON-5) - USB-C 2.0 receptacle, UFP only"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 63.5 72.39 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5c8ff1bb-d90a-44bb-b78a-2749f6a7f386")
	)
	(text "Notes:\n- Route USB_DP / USB_DM as a 90 ohm differential pair at layout (CON-5).\n- No series resistors on D+/D- and no VBUS divider: firmware forces B-valid (pinmap PA9 row).\n- R11 / R12: one 5.1k pulldown per CC pin, NEVER shared - this is a UFP-only port.\n- C25 is local VBUS bulk near the receptacle; VBUS is the bench supply path (PWR-3),\n  OR-ed with the buck output on the Power sheet.\n- SBU1 / SBU2 unused (USB 2.0 only); shell and GND pins go straight to the GND plane.\n- U7 sits between the receptacle and the MCU (flow-through): I/O1 = D-, I/O2 = D+."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 63.5 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7b680bf3-7fed-408a-8cbf-3aa5b4eb8104")
	)
