		(property "Notes" "USB-C receptacle, USB 2.0 only, 16 pin (CON-5). Bench data and bench power (VBUS = PWR-3). Shell tabs straight to the GND plane. Route D+/D- as a 90 ohm differential pair at layout; no series resistors and no VBUS divider (firmware forces B-valid, pinmap PA9 row)."
